						<h2 class="text-dark text-center mt-4">Description</h2>
						<h5 class="text-dark text-center">F1® Mobile Racing is the
							official mobile game of the 2023 FIA Formula One World
							Championship™, featuring this season's teams and drivers[^1^][1].
							You can compete on stunning circuits from this season against the
							greatest drivers on the planet, such as Lewis Hamilton, Max
							Verstappen, Charles Leclerc, and Fernando Alonso[^1^][1]. It's
							you against your rivals in intense, high-stakes F1® action!</h5>

						<h2 class="text-dark text-center mt-5">Special Features</h2>
						<ul class="text-dark text-dark mt-4">
							<li><b>Real-time multiplayer: Duel against players from
									around the world in real-time 1v1 races to earn prizes and rise
									up the Leagues[^1^][1].</b></li>
							<li><b>Career Mode: Start your very own career and sign
									up to represent an official F1® team for a season! Upgrade your
									car and race for the championship[^1^][1].</b></li>
							<li><b>High-Stakes Events: Race in time-limited Grand
									Prix™ Events for big rewards, and combine your scores over each
									event to rank on global leaderboards[^1^][1].</b></li>
							<li><b>Develop and Upgrade Your Own F1® Car: Collect the
									most powerful parts to upgrade your car's performance and find
									the best configuration for each event[^1^][1]!</b></li>
						</ul>
